  "body": "When it comes to property, location is everything - and this one is hard to beat.\r\nPositioned directly across the road from Macleans College, this neat and tidy brick-and-tile home offers an unbeatable combination of location, space and potential.\r\nBoasting approximately 110sqm of floor area, the home features two generous bedrooms with wardrobes, a spacious and comfortable living area, and a light-filled kitchen that flows naturally into the dining space. An internal-access single garage and separate laundry add everyday convenience.\r\nOutside, the fully fenced backyard provides a private and easy-care space for children and pets, with plenty of potential for a veggie garden or your own outdoor retreat.\r\nThe location couldn't be more convenient. Macleans Park is just a short walk away, while local shops, supermarkets, restaurants, beaches and everyday amenities are all within easy reach. Families will particularly appreciate being zoned for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans Primary School.\r\nWhether you're looking to secure a highly sought-after school zone, buying your first home, downsizing, investing, or helping your children take their first step onto the property ladder, this charming Bucklands Beach home deserves your attention.\r\nA fantastic location, generous proportions and plenty of potential - come and see what makes this one special.",
